      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Exceptional Four-Bedroom Coastal Residence on 2.5 Acres with Sea Views\r\n\r\nIf you have been dreaming of a home by the sea, this could be the one.\r\n\r\nDenise Radley Auctioneers are delighted to present this impressive four-bedroom detached residence extending to approximately 2,100 sq. ft., occupying a magnificent 2.5-acre site just off the beautiful Whiting Bay Beach.\r\n\r\nThe setting is what immediately sets this property apart. Surrounded by expansive, beautifully maintained lawns and mature gardens, the house enjoys a wonderful sense of space, peace and privacy, together with stunning sea views from the rear of the property. The scale of the grounds and the beautiful countryside surrounding the residence create a truly special setting.\r\n\r\nInternally, the house is bright, spacious and exceptionally well laid out.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation begins with a spacious entrance porch leading into the main hallway. To the right-hand side of the house are two generous double bedrooms, both with ensuite bathrooms, together with a separate guest WC.\r\n\r\nFurther along the hallway is a comfortable living room featuring a large fitted stove and leading into a lovely sunroom area – a wonderful space in which to relax and enjoy the peaceful surroundings.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen/dining room is positioned to the rear of the house and is one of the standout rooms within the property. A striking double-height ceiling and abundance of natural light create a bright and airy living space. Double doors open directly onto the rear garden, making this an ideal area for everyday family living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nTo the left-hand side of the house is the impressive oversized master bedroom suite. This is a particularly special space, also featuring a double-height ceiling and double doors opening directly onto the garden. The suite incorporates a large walk-in wardrobe and a substantial ensuite bathroom with separate shower and bath.\r\n\r\nPractical accommodation is equally generous, with a large utility room with direct access outside, together with a separate storage room and back kitchen, providing excellent additional storage and working space.\r\n\r\nOutside is where this property really comes into its own. Set on approximately 2.5 acres of beautifully maintained lawns and mature gardens, there is an incredible sense of space and privacy surrounding the house. Whether gardening, entertaining, relaxing or simply enjoying the sea views and peaceful countryside, the grounds are a wonderful feature of this home.\r\n\r\nThere is also a substantial detached garage extending to approximately 800 sq. ft., together with an additional timber storage shed.\r\n\r\nThe location is superb. Whiting Bay Beach is within walking distance, while the picturesque seaside village of Ardmore is only a short drive away. The N25 Cork–Waterford road is approximately four minutes from the property, providing convenient access towards Dungarvan, Youghal, Cork and Waterford.\r\n\r\nThis is more than just a house – it is a lifestyle property in an exceptional coastal setting, offering space, privacy, sea views and one of West Waterford's most beautiful beaches virtually on your doorstep."
      },
